WEBVTT

00:06.200 --> 00:09.120
Advance is death.

00:10.120 --> 00:11.520
Retreat.

00:11.800 --> 00:17.560
Is also death then we have no choice but to fight to the end.

00:21.800 --> 00:23.720
Halt what are you doing?

00:28.400 --> 00:30.640
Can you reach? Can you reach?

00:30.720 --> 00:35.320
Don't waste words with him you, you come do the real work.

00:41.240 --> 00:42.640
General Chen.

00:43.800 --> 00:49.240
You dare kill a court minister this is rebellion brothers follow me to capture the rebels.

00:49.400 --> 00:50.800
Return for reward.

00:53.160 --> 00:58.000
This this what's going on?

00:59.640 --> 01:01.000
What should we do?

01:01.080 --> 01:02.080
What do we do?

01:02.160 --> 01:03.560
Quiet.

01:17.200 --> 01:20.520
Yiyang Army, Beishuo Army, at attention here.

